                                "sense_id": "375b2c1a-72c6-3e06-9763-d512a7608365",
                                "text": "But Perry, Cabrera and Campbell could hear the Masters bird choir tweeting (that’s 140 characters or less, ornithologically speaking) over the quiet of the gallery following them."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
